NOpenGLESDrv for OldUnreal 227k_15 (Unreal Gold PortMaster port).

Applies to Andiweli/UT99-Android 85b1a9ada6ae28c422570d4603e57e4e4cef6eb1
(git apply, from the repository root). Contains ports/ut99's
NOpenGLESDrv469.patch, the 227 port behind NOPENGLES_227, and fixes shared
by both OldUnreal builds (NOPENGLES_OLDUNREAL; the 469e build still
compiles with NOPENGLES_469_COMPAT). Every change carries a comment;
BUILD.md lists them.

