+// Copies Count RGBA texels (BGRA with SwapRB) as RGBA through the tone table
+// of their kind (ETone): ToneLUT, or ToneLightLUT for light maps. Alpha is
+// kept, except on fog maps (ToneFogAlphaLUT). Src may be Dst.
+//
+void UNOpenGLESRenderDevice::ToneRGBA( const BYTE* Src, BYTE* Dst, DWORD Count, UBOOL SwapRB, BYTE Kind ) const
